// ecMethodFix converts EC curve names to their corresponding JWT algorithm names.
// This handles the mapping from standard curve names (P-256, P-384, P-521) to
// JWT algorithm identifiers used in the "alg" parameter.
//
// Mappings:
//   - P-256 → ES256 (ECDSA using P-256 and SHA-256)
//   - P-384 → ES384 (ECDSA using P-384 and SHA-384)
//   - P-521 → ES512 (ECDSA using P-521 and SHA-512)
//
// Note: P-521 maps to ES512, not ES521, as the algorithm name refers to the
// hash function size (SHA-512), not the curve size (521 bits).
//
// Parameters:
//   - curveName: The curve name (either standard form like "P-256" or algorithm form like "ES256")
//
